# Company context

> This file is injected into the system prompt of EVERY agent on every invocation.
> Keep it concise (cap ~8KB). Edit it from the PWA file browser
> (`company/CONTEXT.md`) or directly in this file (`instance/company/CONTEXT.md`).

## Company

- **Name:** _(fill in)_
- **Industry:** _(fill in)_
- **Mission:** _(fill in)_

## Where to find what

Map of paths the agents can read/write in the workspace:

- `company/ideas/` — raw captures (the human drops an idea, an agent organizes it)
- `company/notes/` — free-form notes by date (briefings, retros, decisions)
- `company/decisions/` — formal decisions (1 file per decision, ADR format)
- `company/tasks/<slug>/` — active tasks in a multi-phase workflow
- `repos/` — code produced during tasks (read-only for agents; edited only in worktrees)
- `agents/<name>/knowledge/` — playbooks/knowledge curated per agent

## Conventions

- Dates in ISO (YYYY-MM-DD) unless the context calls for a local format.
- Currency: _(fill in, e.g. USD)_.
- Message language: _(fill in, e.g. English)_.
- Code + comments in English, unless it's company documentation.

## Philosophy

See `instance/company/philosophy.md`. It defines the operational model
(TDD, SDD, Context Management, a mix, etc).
